@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Practice (mock) exam: Exam.IsMock = true, same exam window and endpoints as a real exam
' (ExamDashboard.PracticeButton_OnClick, ExamsController.GetPracticeExams / StartSession,
' SubmissionService.FinalizeAsync)

|Desktop App|
start
:GET /api/exams/student/\npractice; pick an IsMock\nexam, press Practice:\nPOST /api/exams/{id}/\nstart-session;
|Server|
if (Eligible, open,\nseat OK, readiness\n(if required)?) then (yes)
  :Running attempt or\na new ExamSession;
else (no)
  :400/403 with\nmessage (EXAM_\nNOT_STARTED,\nSEAT_MISMATCH,\nREADINESS_\nREQUIRED);
  |Desktop App|
  :Show message\nbox;
  stop
endif
|Desktop App|
:Start monitoring (no\nwebcam), open Exam-\nWindow, lockdown =\nReport (apps only\nreported);
:Answer, auto-save via\nsave-answer, then POST\n/api/exams/sessions/\n{sid}/submit;
|Server|
:FinalizeAsync: receipt,\ngrading (if AI evaluation\non), no plagiarism\ncheck (IsMock);
|Desktop App|
:Show receipt,\nattempts + 1;
stop
@enduml
